; SCEVExpander builds selects to pick the sign of a step when expanding a wrap
; predicate and to pick a bound when expanding a pointer min or max. None of
; them corresponds to a select or branch of the original loop, so in a profiled
; function their branch weights must be marked explicitly unknown to keep
; profile verification happy.

@a = common global [250 x i32] zeroinitializer, align 16

